        "text": "Good question! I tend to think that ML is the tide that lifts all ships, so we'll probably see a lot of things emerge. \n\nObviously theoretical work is close to math, so probably the most straight forward (and iiuc the field is already seeing a lot of amazing results).\n\nAnything related to simulation is also quite low-hanging. Maybe improvements around quantum-simulation? There's been some really cool looking work there already.\n\nI'm also super bullish on automated labs like Periodic. So maybe there will be experimental results that happen sooner than we'd naively expect.",
